{"title":"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(really_a_solution,_DO_THIS_ON_A_REAL_TEST)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (really a solution, DO THIS ON A REAL TEST)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is defined on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a> and satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61e6ea0a631ce5b4cced22cb5da2ef69f5e1a0a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)=\\begin{cases} n-3&amp;\\mbox{if}\\ n\\ge 1000\\\\ f(f(n+5))&amp;\\mbox{if}\\ n&lt;1000\\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"274\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c17988a8c8ecadc307239caa6100f72d4a4358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(84)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58c3a62709ef610cbc95f70dc8777ea19a291521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{h} = f(f(\\cdots f(f(x))\\cdots))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />, where the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is performed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> times. We find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/c/66c84f498bf204338e297889624a553a46e0098a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(84) = f(f(89)) = f^2(89) = f^3(94) = \\ldots f^{y}(1004)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"401\" height=\"19\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/9/d49dd026798fa0731cc6bc0ee30aeced4b9762bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1004 = 84 + 5(y - 1) \\Longrightarrow y = 185$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"265\" height=\"18\" />. So we now need to reduce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb301f7c13cc1c00aa6ca831afc97ebc910bd999.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{185}(1004)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Let’s write out a couple more iterations of this function:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4e2cd968b0d8d8e75c209c34fa4e1722cf5f3f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}f^{185}(1004)&amp;=f^{184}(1001)=f^{183}(998)=f^{184}(1003)=f^{183}(1000)\\\\ &amp;=f^{182}(997)=f^{183}(1002)=f^{182}(999)=f^{183}(1004)\\end{align*}\" width=\"495\" height=\"47\" />\nSo this function reiterates with a period of 2 for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. It might be tempting at first to assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d0871a63aa240a86dc53a5ee5fb96f6a73c5bdd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1004) = 1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" /> is the answer; however, that is not true since the solution occurs slightly before that. Start at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/354ab21d0fed0b70f30b7dc684574095bc8a849e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^3(1004)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"19\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb80f9ca09d81d49b8754df2ae578bf487bb2f1b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f^{3}(1004)=f^{2}(1001)=f(998)=f^{2}(1003)=f(1000)=\\boxed{997}\\]\" width=\"480\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>Note that we should also be suspicious if our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888c508062c09735bab7ff0e11e7dc80cc7580db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />- it is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit number, and we were not asked to, say, divide our number by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We start by finding values of the function right under <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> since they require iteration of the function.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85a9c77436f5cb3c5af3d0c8901fc78474cbfd4d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(999)=f(f(1004))=f(1001)=998\\]\" width=\"298\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/4/a944a7ed2c40c61a67599fd6da6a149a2d7aa08c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(998)=f(f(1003))=f(1000)=997\\]\" width=\"299\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/399f2e0b0c4e69d38f0d9dbe2fd9665fc73fc8d7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(997)=f(f(1002))=f(999)=998\\]\" width=\"289\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/551420d8083eb56bbf1e51c8d37a91fb33063b7c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(996)=f(f(1001))=f(998)=997\\]\" width=\"290\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Soon we realize the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/81232ecd8d9e4b5c0f24a00dabec238068f26de9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> for integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea052bffc0ed1a4ca54fe2017b0223782b43b55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&lt;1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> either equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/1/4914eeac89c1525c3550da96c0efba02a7f0d836.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$998$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/90782e3f18f6a430876413c43e3d163e0e8ae3f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$997$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> based on its parity. (If short on time, a guess of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/1/4914eeac89c1525c3550da96c0efba02a7f0d836.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$998$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/90782e3f18f6a430876413c43e3d163e0e8ae3f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$997$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> can be taken now.)\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is even, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a1ccc82a0de8ee1022ae9dd7c166378ccf7fb7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(k)=997$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is odd, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/7/207ff8e411a2935fd01f5f52f40931f6b510a29c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(k)=998$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/4131457f67c5dbfd8b1c6be1f74a47595a9bd3be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> has even parity, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a8d5b715b1700c32c0f98d4b82734bfee1cc393.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(84)=997$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />.\nThe result may be rigorously shown through induction.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c17988a8c8ecadc307239caa6100f72d4a4358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(84)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" /> is to be performed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3efd9b14723a92c2ae891fe27780d5f8e2b215.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> times. Then we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d93c0a0e3acf66ddc02aada8c3a25d238f51c9a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(84)=f^{n+1}(84)=f(f^n(84+5))\\]\" width=\"267\" height=\"19\" />\nIn order to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c17988a8c8ecadc307239caa6100f72d4a4358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(84)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" />, we want to know the smallest value of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b78c3e88444f37798f9b5c8b1ff90a050f7f689e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f^n(84+5)\\ge1000\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />\nBecause then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c81c39639dad04ee5936a18302af8474a766698.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(84)=f(f^n(84+5))=(f^n(84+5))-3\\]\" width=\"328\" height=\"18\" />\nFrom which we'll get a numerical value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c17988a8c8ecadc307239caa6100f72d4a4358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(84)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Notice that the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> we expect to find is basically the smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/d/5fd5781d376b155fe1c7ccd3e47d37d46fcacd50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=f(f(x+5))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> is performed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f275b1f33e3c37ece0e41964f0bcb806e95b46b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"13\" height=\"33\" /> times and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/3/a335291ad1ccc1401984c6f8abaf46d5483a49ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" /> is performed back <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f275b1f33e3c37ece0e41964f0bcb806e95b46b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"13\" height=\"33\" /> times, the result is greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>In this case, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c17988a8c8ecadc307239caa6100f72d4a4358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(84)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/9/0498fe21b29cf0b4ea7c69dec368ed6d08147dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$916$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, because\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/e/fbe7e7960ac3ace98dafdbe7b41d1c01d6ff0ee6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[84+\\frac{916}{2}\\cdot5-\\frac{916}{2}\\cdot3=1000\\Longrightarrow f^{916}(84+5))=1000\\]\" width=\"431\" height=\"37\" />\nThus\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/1/b41f8cb98d5bdbd04d71f9994792bf81c7094186.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(84)=f(f^{916}(84+5))=f(1000)=1000-3=\\boxed{997}\\]\" width=\"428\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28really_a_solution.2C_DO_THIS_ON_A_REAL_TEST.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(really_a_solution,_DO_THIS_ON_A_REAL_TEST)\">Solution 4 (really a solution, DO THIS ON A REAL TEST)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (really a solution, DO THIS ON A REAL TEST)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Open up a coding IDE and use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Recursion\" title=\"Recursion\">recursion</a> to do this problem. The idea is to define a function (I called it <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />, you can call it whatever you want) with parameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> (or 84 in this case) and say if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is greater than 1000, then return <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/5/31503c8c86ff405ea9ae2dd6285eecb04550cb97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />. Else, return <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b0617050f8e1207abc94b16054c7113a47d9a405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(n + 5))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" />. Python code:\n</p>\n<pre>   def f(n):\n       if n &gt;= 1000:\n           return n - 3\n       else:\n           return f(f(n + 5))\n   print(f(84))\n</pre>\n<p><br />\nOr [python]def f(n):\n</p>\n<pre>  if n &lt; 1000:\n       return f(f(n + 5))\n  else:\n      return n-3\n</pre>\n<p>print(f(84))[/python]\n</p><p>~ NL008, Sernegeti22\n</p><p>Note:\n\"Do THIS ON A REAL TEST\" does not mean open up python on the real AIME(hopefully)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME\" title=\"1984 AIME\">1984 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a>